// CLAIM: a native is reachable only through `use M::*` or `use M::name` -- importing another item of the same module (`use std::math::PI`) does not unlock `sqrt`.
// GUIDE: SkarnGuide.md 22 (Input, output, and the standard natives)
// EXPECT: fail requires `use std::math::*` or `use std::math::sqrt`
use std::math::PI
println(PI)
println(sqrt(9.0))
